{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:4ndr0prompts:hdl:v8",
  "title": "4ndr0prompts HDL v8 — Canonical Compiler Schema",
  "description": "Normative seven-block HDL v8 structure. Two root sections (!INIT_MEM_LOCK, !INIT_ATMOSPHERICS); within atmospherics require bio/dermal mapping, composition, photometry, material physics, and negative bias. Extra geometric, text-reconstruction, and finalization blocks from the 11.3.1 compiler are valid optional extensions. Strict root forbids competing module authorities. Catalog values remain open; hardware/semantic coherence requires additional checks.",
  "$comment": "This is the primary contract for the 7-stage HDL workstation; legacy prompt_arc.py shape is specified separately in hdl-v8.prompt-arc-legacy.schema.json.",
